@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> Create Task : User creates a new task
Create Task --> Assign Task : Assign task to self or others
Assign Task --> Set Deadline : Set deadline for the task
Set Deadline --> Track Progress : Track task progress
Track Progress --> Check Status : Check task status
Check Status --> [*] : View task history and status

Create Task --> Set Deadline : Directly set deadline without assignment
Assign Task --> Track Progress : Track progress after assignment
Set Deadline --> View Task History : View task history
Track Progress --> View All Statuses : View all tasks' statuses
View All Statuses --> [*] : Return to initial state

View Task History --> [*] : Return to initial state
Check Status --> View Task History : View task history
Track Progress --> View Task History : View task history
Set Deadline --> View All Statuses : View all tasks' statuses
Assign Task --> View All Statuses : View all tasks' statuses
Create Task --> View All Statuses : View all tasks' statuses

Start --> [*] : System initialization
@enduml
